If "<ArcLink5$Running>" = "True" then Error 0 ArcLink5 is already loaded. You can only run one copy of ArcLink5 at once.
If "<System$Path>" = "" then Error 0 System resources cannot be found. Please locate !System and try again.
Wimpslot -min 220K -max 220K
IconSprites <Obey$Dir>.!Sprites
Set ArcLink5$Path <Obey$Dir>
RMEnsure ABCLibrary 4.02 RMLoad System:modules.ABCLib
RMEnsure ABCLibrary 4.02 Error You need ABCLib 4.02 or later to run !ArcLink5
Run <ArcLink5$Path>.!RunImage %*0
UnSet ArcLink5$Running